:: i5 [i5 explore]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->i5: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Buy something at the street market.->i5: street market]]</li>
      <li>[[Go to the vending machine->i5: vending machine]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'i5'>><<n>><<e>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'i5'>>
</div>

:: i5: vending machine [i5 cedar-oasis vending-machine]
<<include 'cedar oasis: vending machine'>>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Continue exploring the city.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>